WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:11.975
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT HAS BEEN MANY

00:00:11.976 --> 00:00:13.743
MONTHS SINCE THE MASS SHOOTING

00:00:13.744 --> 00:00:14.677
IN LAS VEGAS, THE LARGEST IN

00:00:14.678 --> 00:00:18.314
MODERN AMERICAN HISTORY.

00:00:18.315 --> 00:00:23.353
EVEN NOW KEY INFORMATION

00:00:23.354 --> 00:00:25.922
CONTINUES TO TRICKLE OUT.

00:00:25.923 --> 00:00:27.957
EVEN AS STEPHEN PADDOCK

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.928
THE OBVIOUS QUESTION IS, WHY IS

00:00:31.929 --> 00:00:33.963
THIS FOOTAGE COMING OUT NOW AND

00:00:33.964 --> 00:00:36.733
WHY DID THE POLICE NOT ACT FOR

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:37.533
SEVERAL MINUTES?

00:00:37.534 --> 00:00:38.768
CATHERINE BARDO IS AN ATTORNEY

00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:40.637
REPRESENTING SOME OF THE VICTIMS

00:00:40.638 --> 00:00:43.473
OF THOSE SHOOTINGS AND SHE JOINS

00:00:43.474 --> 00:00:44.540
US.

00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:46.876
THANK YOU FOR COMING ON.

00:00:46.877 --> 00:00:48.177
THE FIRST QUESTION IS, WHY ARE

00:00:48.178 --> 00:00:49.345
WE FINDING THIS OUT NOW?

00:00:49.346 --> 00:00:51.281
IT SEEMS LIKE A CENTRAL PIECE OF

00:00:51.282 --> 00:00:54.951
INFORMATION IN THE STORY.

00:00:54.952 --> 00:00:57.153
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE THE COURTS ORDERED

00:00:57.154 --> 00:00:58.554
THE LAS VEGAS METRO POLICE

00:00:58.555 --> 00:01:01.758
DEPARTMENT TO RELEASE ALL OF

00:01:01.759 --> 00:01:02.492
THIS VIDEO FOOTAGE AND PURSUANT

00:01:02.493 --> 00:01:06.562
TO COURT ORDER, THEY ARE

00:01:06.563 --> 00:01:09.198
RELEASING IT PIECE BY PIECE OVER

00:01:09.199 --> 00:01:10.600
THE LAST COUPLE MONTHS.

00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:12.368
AS YOU KNOW, YESTERDAY WE

00:01:12.369 --> 00:01:13.636
RECEIVED ABOUT A DOZEN VIDEOS

00:01:13.637 --> 00:01:19.509
AND MANY MORE AUDIO VIDEOS

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:22.211
SHOWING MOSTLY POLICE OFFICER

00:01:22.212 --> 00:01:22.845
BODY WORN CAMERA FOOTAGE.

00:01:22.846 --> 00:01:27.216
IT'S FASCINATING AND IT IS ALSO

00:01:27.217 --> 00:01:28.918
VERY, VERY UPSETTING.

00:01:28.919 --> 00:01:29.919
IT SHOWS THE EXTREMIS OF THE

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.823
EVENT AND OF THE TRAUMA THAT

00:01:33.824 --> 00:01:36.693
EVERYONE THERE, THE 22,000

00:01:36.694 --> 00:01:38.161
PEOPLE WHO ARE THERE HAVE

00:01:38.162 --> 00:01:38.928
SUFFERED.

00:01:38.929 --> 00:01:40.897
I HAVE BEEN IN THAT VERY HALLWAY

00:01:46.403 --> 00:01:46.803
32ND FLOOR.

00:01:53.744 --> 00:01:55.545
AND WHAT THE VIDEO CLEARLY SHOWS

00:01:55.546 --> 00:01:56.946
IS ONE PARTICULAR POLICE OFFICER

00:01:56.947 --> 00:01:59.349
WAS ON THE 31ST FLOOR.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:03.786
NOT THE 32ND FLOOR, AND HE WAS

00:02:03.787 --> 00:02:05.521
THERE FOR MANY MOMENTS.

00:02:05.522 --> 00:02:07.623
WHAT WE FIND INTERESTING IS THAT

00:02:07.624 --> 00:02:08.524
THE MANDALAY BAY SECURITY

00:02:08.525 --> 00:02:09.759
OFFICER WHO WAS WITH THAT

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:10.526
PARTICULAR POLICE OFFICER BEFORE

00:02:10.527 --> 00:02:14.263
THE SHOOTING STARTED AND RACED

00:02:14.264 --> 00:02:15.365
THROUGH THE CASINO FLOOR AND

00:02:15.366 --> 00:02:17.834
RACED UP THE ELEVATORS WITH HIM,

00:02:17.835 --> 00:02:19.202
THIS PARTICULAR MANDALAY BAY

00:02:19.203 --> 00:02:20.336
SECURITY GUARD SAID THAT HE WAS

00:02:20.337 --> 00:02:24.607
ON THE 30 SECOND-FLOOR WITH THAT

00:02:24.608 --> 00:02:27.243
PARTICULAR OFFICER IN THE VIDEO

00:02:27.244 --> 00:02:30.179
ON THE 31ST FLOOR.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:30.913
THIS MANDALAY BAY SECURITY

00:02:30.914 --> 00:02:34.751
MANAGER TOLD THE FBI ON NINE

00:02:34.752 --> 00:02:35.385
SEPARATE OCCASIONS IN HIS

00:02:35.386 --> 00:02:37.754
INTERVIEWS THAT HE WAS CERTAIN

00:02:37.755 --> 00:02:39.489
HE WAS WITH THIS OFFICER HENDRIX

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:45.962
ON THE 30 SECOND-FLOOR.

00:02:45.963 --> 00:02:46.729
THEY ALREADY KNEW OFFICER

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:49.165
HENDRIX WAS ON THE 31ST FLOOR

00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:49.866
BUT, IT WASN'T UNTIL YESTERDAY

00:02:49.867 --> 00:02:51.768
WHEN ALL OF THAT VIDEO WAS

00:02:51.769 --> 00:02:52.735
RELEASED THAT WE FINALLY GOT

00:02:52.736 --> 00:02:54.570
CONFIRMATION THAT SOMETHING IS

00:02:54.571 --> 00:02:55.772
WRONG, SOMETHING IS AMISS.

00:02:59.743 --> 00:03:01.377
SCRATCHED THE SURFACE.

00:03:01.378 --> 00:03:02.178
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT'S UNBELIEVABLE.

00:03:02.179 --> 00:03:03.780
THIS IS THE SECOND TIME IN

00:03:03.781 --> 00:03:04.947
SEVERAL MONTHS WE'VE SEEN ARMED

00:03:04.948 --> 00:03:07.183
POLICE OFFICERS STAND THERE

00:03:07.184 --> 00:03:09.185
WHILE A MASS MURDER TAKES PLACE.

00:03:09.186 --> 00:03:10.987
I'M SYMPATHETIC TO COPS BECAUSE

00:03:10.988 --> 00:03:12.989
THEY TAKE A LOT OF BUT I THINK

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:14.424
WE DESERVE AN EXPLANATION FOR

00:03:14.425 --> 00:03:15.992
WHY THIS KEEPS HAPPENING.

00:03:15.993 --> 00:03:17.393
&gt;&gt; AS ON MY.

00:03:17.394 --> 00:03:19.796
ONE LAST THOUGHT ON THAT, I HAVE

00:03:19.797 --> 00:03:21.831
A CLIENT WHOSE SPOUSE WAS SHOT

00:03:27.337 --> 00:03:28.938
AND I JUST WANT TO PUT THAT OUT

